  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After Assimilation Wind Song drove research into counters, Western Desert’s rank eight Gu Immortal Thousand Transformations Ancestor sought its fundamental flaw with help from a rank eight time path great expert. They saw the power of the true stability tree in the River of Time, and on returning he created the transformation path killer move true stability transformation. The move can restrict the winds of assimilation.",
      "chapters": [
        1547
      ],
