    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan deduced true stability branch transformation as a simplified version of true stability transformation, using the light of wisdom and his transformation path attainment, to prepare for Feng Jiu Ge’s attack on Lang Ya blessed land. Lang Ya land spirit activates that branch form against the winds of assimilation and turns the silver giant into a branch of the true stability tree, which blocks the wind. The branch form costs heavy immortal essence and mental energy to sustain, and Lang Ya land spirit had practised it little before the fight.",
      "chapters": [
